b.residual('capability_authority_and_proof_dependency','tenant_manifest','Concrete accepted capability-definition graph, installed public catalog, exact tenant manifest, HANDLERS domain and owning enforcement proof are not supplied here.','Do not turn declared support, package presence or this structural representation into realized conformance or release proof.',[(7,50,77)])
